{"title":"2008 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa96fe895928cf7fdf0b3b0bc58cb29d26940589.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\textdollar b = (a - b)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"21\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/7/e17e90fb46bef89af5918915f2657223b4d3a97c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - y)^2\\textdollar(y - x)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"19\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/d/a5d332b3154f10887f1cdc4e6c141d8c3924c9f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ x^2 + y^2 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 2x^2 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 2y^2 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 4xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"454\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/7/197c4c2e51a2ef944c7e964782f5a8df8a22b606.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left[ (x-y)^2 - (y-x)^2 \\right]^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"170\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/7/fd7fd835e362057186d253e0724a1b0b5c07580f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left[ (x-y)^2 - (x-y)^2 \\right]^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"170\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/e/b7e1d01b94c63fb026726b3c9b84d79c1aaed490.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[0]^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"25\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/a/9ba257fbf8334950e3e37a70797a3577d21a9dc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\Rightarrow \\textbf{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B\" title=\"2008 AMC 12B\">2008 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 AMC 12B Pro